OL,4,BKhawaja 'disappointed' by Cummins'     
OL,5,Bpersonal attack                        
OL,6,GUsman Khawaja says he is               
OL,7,G"disappointed" by the personal         
OL,8,G"attack" he faced from Pat Cummins in  
OL,9,Gresponse to his claims about the 2018  
OL,10,Gball-tampering scandal, stating he has 
OL,11,G"never seen that side" of Australia's  
OL,12,GTest captain.                          
OL,14,FRetired batter Khawaja reignited       
OL,15,Fdebate around 'sandpapergate' in his   
OL,16,Fautobiography Sabr, claiming the       
OL,17,Fentire Australia team knew about the   
OL,18,Fplan to tamper with the ball in the    
OL,19,Fthird Test of their series against     
OL,20,FSouth Africa in Cape Town.             
